WEBVTT

00:00:56.814 --> 00:01:00.460
I was angry, I was bitter,

00:01:00.460 --> 00:01:04.152
and all I wanted was revenge.

00:01:04.152 --> 00:01:06.659
But that changed when I was 18.

00:01:06.659 --> 00:01:10.096
I decided that I needed
Hebrew to get a job,

00:01:10.096 --> 00:01:12.603
and going to study Hebrew
in that classroom

00:01:12.603 --> 00:01:18.037
was the first time I ever met Jews
who were not soldiers.

00:01:18.037 --> 00:01:22.919
And we connected over really small things,
like the fact that I love country music,

00:01:22.919 --> 00:01:26.646
which is really strange
for Palestinians.

00:01:26.646 --> 00:01:31.306
But it was then that I realized also
that we have a wall of anger,